          <string name="Name">_HowToUse</string>
          <string name="Value">Ready-made 3D meshes: import meshes/VikingAssets.glb (File > Import 3D) and press Play, the game finds it by itself. Or drop your own models in this folder named exactly like a slot: Longhouse, Cottage, Woodcutter, Quarry, Farm, Storehouse, Palisade, LoreHall, Smithy, Shrine, Shipyard, HuntingLodge, GreatHall, Watchtower, Tree_Pine, Tree_Spruce, Tree_Birch, Rock, Bush, Dock, Deer, Longship, Axe, Pickaxe, Bow, Torch, Sword, Prop_Cart, Prop_Haystack, Prop_FishRack, Prop_Barrels, Prop_Woodpile, Prop_Banner, Prop_BoatUpturned. See meshes/README.md.</string>
